<title>USA: Seattle, Wash., $57 mln GO adjustable rate priced.</title>
<headline>Seattle, Wash., $57 mln GO adjustable rate priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it priced $57.5 million of Seattle, Wash., general obligation limited tax taxable adjustable rate bonds.</p>
<p>The issue was priced with a 5.50 coupon at par and is due in 2026.</p>
<p>The issue is dated 8/28/1996 and due 1/15/2026.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
